<title>FINLAND: FINNISH FOREST INDUSTRY 97 PROFIT FIM 6 BLN - MTK.</title>
<headline>FINNISH FOREST INDUSTRY 97 PROFIT FIM 6 BLN - MTK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish forest industry's profit after financial items is expected to grow to six billion markka this year from 5.6 billion in 1996, the Finnish Central Union of Agricultural Producers and Forest Owners said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
